{"tool":"web.run","request":{"open":[{"ref_id":"https://www.cls.cn/detail/2478864","lineno":1}],"response_length":"long"},"raw_response":" (https://www.cls.cn/detail/2478864)\nciteturn4view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 days ago; Content type: text/plain; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.cls.cn/detail/2478864\",\"lineno\":1}); Total lines: 33\nL0: <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\" data-next-head=\"\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\" data-next-head=\"\"/><meta name=\"description\" content=\"贝森特亮出的“救市底牌” 如何成了一张惊吓市场的“烂牌”？\" data-next-head=\"\"/><title data-next-head=\"\">贝森特亮出的“救市底牌” 如何成了一张惊吓市场的“烂牌”？</title><meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\"/><meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\"/><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Language\" content=\"zh-cn\"/><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/><meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\"/><meta name=\"force-rendering\" content=\"webkit\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cls.cn/www/20200601/image/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://wwwjs.cls.cn/_next/static/css/5e21c3f45c5c1b9e.css\" as=\"style\"/><script src=\"https://cdnjs.cls.cn/www/20180717/js/baidu.js\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" charSet=\"UTF-8\" href=\"/css/slick.css\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" charSet=\"UTF-8\" href=\"/css/slick-theme.min.css\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" charSet=\"UTF-8\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cls.cn/www/20200601/css/iconfont.css\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cls.cn/www/20260803/css/global-2026083.css\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" charSet=\"UTF-8\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cls.cn/www/20260318/css/detail-2026031.css\"/><noscript><strong>很抱歉，当前没有启用javascript，网站无法正常访问。请开启以便继续访问。</strong></noscript><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wwwjs.cls.cn/_next/static/css/5e21c3f45c5c1b9e.css\" data-n-p=\"\"/><noscript d